      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#2 · the second forgetting; the Simulation concept's disclosure demand",
          "title": "The frame calls its boundary the horizon",
          "italic": "Usurpation embodies constitutive limitation become jurisdiction: the operation that made a situation intelligible now judges every subsequent situation — capture begins when results circulate as self-originating authority.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The second forgetting begins when a finite measure loses its relation to being finite. The frame now calls its own boundary the horizon of reality; what it cannot admit is redescribed as unreal, irrelevant or already explained. This changes the eye's encounter with another person: before the person can answer, the frame supplies a role, score, diagnosis or expected motive; their words become further evidence of what the frame already knew. A determination claims its determining power — x acts as X, the reflected image as its source, the local 1 as the 0 on which it depends. Psychically a complex can",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
