      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#3 · Watson 1998; Gebser; the corrected optical assignments; C38's local-Bimba office",
          "title": "The Other interrupts — regard, context, refraction",
          "italic": "Regard begins when the excess can alter the measure of the encounter: attention becomes answerable, the criterion questionable by what it concerns.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The Other interrupts. A reply refuses the role prepared for it; an encounter changes which question deserves to be asked. Regard begins when this excess can alter the measure of the encounter — attention becomes answerable, the person still judging and acting but the criterion now questionable by what it concerns. Watson's sequence through Gans's Levinas gives the interpersonal pressure: the face-to-face exceeds the image held of the Other, and ethical excess cannot be represented as a stronger quantity on an unchanged scale. Context weaves the newly available relations: one view meets a counterview, their conditions legible through their difference — the 180°→360° movement,",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "never an omniscient panorama; another angle discloses an occlusion and carries its own. The stained window lets the change be seen: light through panes, lead seams marking divisions, projection changing with sun and viewer; Bimba the Original order, QL the immanent spectrum, MEF the refractive operation, pratibimba the situated display. Within a declared Context Frame an achieved image can genuinely become local Bimba while remaining pratibimba to wider sources — returned experience can revise the local reference itself. The holographic unit: the whole descent carried through one unit that retains its relations to condition, articulation, contraction, manifestation and return.\n\nOccurrences: the interrupting reply (#2, #3); the window's assignments (shared with the stained-glass whole); the local-Bimba office (#3, #5→0).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
